      "claim": "Levocetirizine's negligible brain H1-receptor occupancy is attributed to its zwitterionic, efflux-prone antihistamine structure; this negative CNS-access result is not transferable to the neutral, non-ionizable carbamazepine tricyclic carboxamide.",
      "evidence_role": "contradictory"
